        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "addd33eff3c0",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "React is a popular JavaScript library for building interactive user interfaces. As applications grow, managing data and preventing common coding mistakes can become more challenging. TypeScript helps developers handle these challenges by adding static types to JavaScript."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "8c124a359991",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "97a9f20ce11d",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What Is TypeScript?"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "8343c0f318b0",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "9d0900aa3bc1",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "TypeScript is a programming language built on JavaScript. It allows developers to define the types of variables, function parameters, and returned values. This helps identify many errors while writing code instead of discovering them only after running the application."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "028396bc738f",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b3ad9b3cd0dd",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Benefits for React Developers"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "52ceb0ba5604",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "1069d8f69fb8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "TypeScript makes React components easier to understand by clearly defining the data they receive through props. It also provides better autocomplete and editor suggestions, which can improve development speed and code readability."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "aa95c6adb29d",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "ef07f847cbd8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Other benefits include:"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
