        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "964640afb1d9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "React allows developers to split a user interface into small, reusable components. Instead of writing the same code repeatedly, developers can create a component once and use it in different parts of an application."
